n money by banishing ghosts to unlock advanced gear or start as a broke ghost hunter with basic tools at your disposal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ghost Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 different ghost types, each with unique behaviors, keeping you on your toes and making every haunting unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play How You Want</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your challenge: You can play with 0, 1, 2, or 3 evidence, with varying difficulties to match your skill and strategy.</p>","developers":["Outstretched Gaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997500/2eb6079d548da824e581724402e0f5bbec352328/header.jpg?t=1759126359","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997500/974501990/5b6845bbf121b3fbf24fe5461ce843b2be8f1f1c/1756496166/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756913640","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997500/974501990/5b6845bbf121b3fbf24fe5461ce843b2be8f1f1c/1756496166/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756913640","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997500/974501990/5b6845bbf121b3fbf24fe5461ce843b2be8f1f1c/1756496166/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756913640","id":257190875,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190875/movie480.mp4?t=1756913640","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190875/movie_max.mp4?t=1756913640"},"name":"Banished Souls",